### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 82/100.** Evidence Tau2 94.2% ; IFBench 79.9 ; TB Hard 43.2; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 78/100.** Evidence GPQA 86.6 ; HLE 35.7 ; Index 43; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 100/100.** 1M (Base 256K) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 15/100.** Text-only (Pro); scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 82/100.** Evidence SciCode 50.2 ; Coding Index 60.2; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 85/100.** Paid $0.435/$0.87 Xiaomi native ($1/$3 routes).
- **Overall Score: 71/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (82+78+100+15+82)/5=71.4 → 71; best-fit per scoring methodology.

